      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Entonces, de la espuma, subió una figura brillante con una vasija llena hasta el borde.",
          "en": "Then, from the foam, a shining figure rose up, holding a pot filled to the brim."
        },
        {
          "es": "Era Dhanvantari, el médico de los dioses. La vasija estaba llena de amrita.",
          "en": "It was Dhanvantari, the physician of the gods. The pot was full of amrita."
        },
        {
          "es": "El Bhagavata Purana dice que era una parte del mismo Vishnu.",
          "en": "The Bhagavata Purana says he was a part of Vishnu himself."
        },
        {
          "es": "Muchos hindúes lo honran hoy como el dios del Ayurveda, la medicina tradicional de la India.",
          "en": "Many Hindus honor him today as the god of Ayurveda, India's traditional medicine."
